 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Nuances of the three auxiliaries",
     "texto": [
      "**Essere**: «La porta è chiusa» (it can be a state: the door is shut, or a passive action depending on the context).",
      "**Venire (simple tenses only)**: «La porta viene chiusa alle dieci» (a dynamic action: the door is shut / is shut every day at ten). «*è venuta chiusa» does not exist.",
      "**Andare + past participle**: «Questo modulo va compilato» (must be filled in / has to be filled in); «Le regole vanno rispettate» (the rules must be respected)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The sense of loss with «andare»",
     "texto": [
      "In certain contexts with verbs such as perdere, distruggere or disperdere, «andare» shows an unintended result or completed damage: «Molti documenti storici andarono perduti durante l'alluvione» (many historical documents were lost during the flood)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
